<title>USA: Maxwell Technologies Inc Q4 net drops.</title>
<headline>Maxwell Technologies Inc Q4 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended July 31:			1996		1995</p>
<p>Sales				     $ 22,068,000    $ 21,988,000</p>
<p>Net income				$    153,000    $    219,000</p>
<p>Primary earnings per share		   $0.05	     $0.08</p>
<p>Year Ended July 31:			   1996		1995</p>
<p>Sales				     $ 80,911,000    $ 75,004,000</p>
<p>Net income (loss)		     $(15,176,000)   $    315,000</p>
<p>Income (loss) per share		     ($5.53)	    $0.12</p>
<p>NOTE: Year 1996 net inlcudes $14.4 million charge for restructuring and wirte-off.</p>
<p>Company reported earnings after market closed.</p>
